+# Security & Compliance Checklist for QPU usage
+
+1. Provider Credentials
+ - Store all provider API tokens in Secrets Manager / Vault; grant pods access via IRSA or mounted secrets only to the qpu-worker SA.
+ - Rotate credentials regularly and record rotation events as evidence.
+
+2. Billing & Quotas
+ - Record estimated and actual cost per job in BillingRecord table.
+ - Reconcile provider invoices periodically and store reconciliation evidence.
+ - Enforce per-tenant quotas in admission controller or at queue submission.
+
+3. Contract capture
+ - Capture provider terms and attach job-level acceptance metadata into Evidence S3.
+ - For paid providers, maintain signed acceptance by tenant administrator before first job.
+
+4. Audit trail
+ - All submissions, results, cancellations, and billing records must be uploaded to evidence S3 and signed (cosign) when bundling.
+ - Retain evidence with Object Lock per retention policy.
+
